cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pyWellSFMUI: web interface for the pyWellSFM stratigraphic forward modeling simulator"
abstract: >-
  pyWellSFMUI is a web-based interface for pyWellSFM. It lets users create,
  edit, load and save simulation inputs, run stratigraphic forward
  simulations along wells, and visualize the results.
authors:
